<title>UK: No UK grain trade bids at weekly EU tender.</title>
<headline>No UK grain trade bids at weekly EU tender.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were no bids from the UK grain trade at the weekly European Union grain tender, the UK Intervention Board for Agricultural Produce said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
